# Copy to ~/.claude/time-logger/repo-project.map
# Maps a local repo directory name to a Jira project key, tab separated.
# Repos not listed are reported as untracked instead of matched to a ticket.
#
# The map is a hard filter, not a hint: work in a mapped repo can only ever be
# proposed against that project's tickets.

acme-api	ACME
acme-web	WEB

# Several projects for one repo, when its work spans them:
# example-repo	PROJ,OTHER
